              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi baguqula inkazimulo kaNkulunkulu ongabhubhiyo yaba ngumfanekiso womuntu obhubhayo, nezinyoni, nezilwane ezinezinyawo ezine, nezilwanyana ezinwabuzelayo.",
          "type": "text",
